usage: power166.py [-h] [--activity ACTIVITY] [--source-root SOURCE_ROOT]
                   [--tool-root TOOL_ROOT] [--ppa-root PPA_ROOT]
                   [--formality-root FORMALITY_ROOT]
                   [--target-root TARGET_ROOT] --out OUT
                   [--preflight-root PREFLIGHT_ROOT] [--task-ids TASK_IDS]
                   [--pt PT] [--lc-root LC_ROOT] [--timeout TIMEOUT]
                   [--inventory-timeout INVENTORY_TIMEOUT]
                   {prepare,verify,run,campaign}

Own S2e155 target power, with unchanged120/89/109 capture provenance.
Python3.6+, standard library only. Task0 preflight and full12 campaign use the
same code path. All results are diagnostic and NOT_QUALIFIED. Never restarts a
native run or overwrites an existing campaign. No credentials or network.

positional arguments:
  {prepare,verify,run,campaign}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --activity ACTIVITY
  --source-root SOURCE_ROOT
  --tool-root TOOL_ROOT
  --ppa-root PPA_ROOT
  --formality-root FORMALITY_ROOT
  --target-root TARGET_ROOT
  --out OUT
  --preflight-root PREFLIGHT_ROOT
                        successful same155 task0 output; mandatory before
                        full12 prepare/campaign
  --task-ids TASK_IDS
  --pt PT
  --lc-root LC_ROOT
  --timeout TIMEOUT
  --inventory-timeout INVENTORY_TIMEOUT
